  <section class="et-story">
    <div class="et-story__grid">
      <div>
        <img src="{{ 'founder-story.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Pamela, founder of Earth &amp; Tonic" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1125">
      </div>
      <div class="et-split__body">
        <span class="et-eyebrow et-fg60">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="et-h2"><span class="et-italic">Why</span> I started</h2>
        <div class="et-mt-lg et-fg70" style="display:grid;gap:1.25rem;line-height:1.8">
          <p>Earth &amp; Tonic started during my own health journey after being diagnosed with PCOS. I began researching herbs and natural ingredients to better understand my body, and what started as a personal passion quickly turned into something I genuinely loved.</p>
          <p>I create products with clean, thoughtfully chosen ingredients because I truly believe we don't always need all the extra additives to care for our bodies.</p>
